        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "Idea Part 3: Break the Tradition\u000b第三部分：打破传统"
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "New Panamera appears on the crown"
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "顶部显示屏出现全新 Panamera"
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "The new Panamera travels downwards via the V groove. And arrows start rotating."
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "随着全新 Panamera 向下驶出，大楼表面箭头滚动起来"
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "The screen breaks and new Panamera speeds through it"
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "中间显示屏被打碎，全新 Panamera 从里面冲出"
        }
      ],
      "images": [
        "slide-06-img1.gif",
        "slide-06-img2.png"
