      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "texts": [
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "The lights on the body changes along the sound. Huge countdown numbers appear on the crown."
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "随着引擎声响起，大楼灯光随着声音出现变化，顶部巨大的数字倒计时亮起"
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "When the number reaches zero, all the lights are turned on and the highlight of the show starts."
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "变为 0 时，灯光全部亮起，灯光秀进入高潮"
        },
        {
          "type": "body",
          "text": "Idea Part 4: Countdown\u000b第四部分：倒数"
        }
      ],
